+      deferred_to_drive_review (or auto_pass ...)'. A gates.plays.understand off run is neither an auto-pass nor
+      a deferral, so a correct run fails SE-16, or a play following SE-16 writes a review record the config said
+      not to. The same gap has a real consequence here that /vision did not have: with the gate skipped by
+      config, a run that raised the box leaves a proposed decision in the model and no review record naming it
+      as its own line, so the drive's review can miss it. Say in C13 first how a skipped or auto-passed gate
