+  - id: H3
+    category: harness
+    severity: P3
+    title: "SE-15 says an in-drive run 'did not wait at Step 0a', but C1, C13 and Step 0a require the play to stop and ask when the contract has no seed answers"
+    path: core/components/plays/understand/SKILL.md
+    also: core/components/plays/understand/reference/ice.md
+    principle: "A drive does not stop for plays' checkpoints, but a question the drive did not answer stops the play; the play never picks an answer itself."
