+  - id: H6
+    category: harness
+    severity: P4
+    title: "Three stale statements still read as if nothing is committed without an approval and every decision is accepted"
+    path: core/components/plays/understand/reference/ice.md
+    also: core/components/plays/understand/SKILL.md
+    principle: "A compiled play is one contract read whole every run; an intent change must reword every sentence that enumerates how a gate resolves or what status a decision has."
+    source: "CLAUDE.md Play Pipeline Rules (the compiled file is the generated whole); main:core/components/plays/vision/SKILL.md (precedent reworded its F6/REC6 for the deferral)"
+    detail: >
+      (a) ice.md C8 still says each box-move decision is 'COMMITTED only on approval' with no in-drive
