+  - id: H8
+    category: harness
+    severity: P4
+    title: "Done means (D1-D3) is unchanged, so the in-drive path (record written, decisions proposed, no wait) is proven only by step evals SE-15/SE-16, not at close"
+    path: core/components/plays/understand/reference/ice.md
+    principle: "A play's Done means is composed from the scenarios' measures and the artifact-verifiable constraints; S7's measure lists the review record, the ledger line and the proposed decisions, all artifact-verifiable."
+    source: "main:core/components/plays/play-creator/SKILL.md ('Done means (#464)'); main:core/components/plays/understand/stop-condition.yaml (D1-D3 as on main); main:core/components/plays/vision (same choice, merged under #614)"
